  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description\">\n  <p class=\"product-summary\">The Explorer Duffle Bag 28 is made for trips and travel. Crafted of Signature canvas and smooth leather, this duffle bag includes inside snap, cell phone and multifunction pockets for easy organization, and it comfortably fits a tablet. The detachable strap and side handle offer versatile carrying options.</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"product-highlights\">\n    <h4>Product Specifications</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Material:</strong> Explorer Duffle Bag 28 In Signature Canvas With Patches</li>\n      <li><strong>Lining:</strong> Recycled polyester lining</li>\n      <li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip closure</li>\n      <li><strong>Organization:</strong> Inside snap, cell phone and multifunction pockets</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;\">📏 Size & Measurement Guide</summary>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n      <tbody>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Dimensions (L x H x W)</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">11.0&quot; (L) x 6.5&quot; (H) x 5.25&quot; (W)</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Handle Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Handles with 4\\&quot; drop Side handle</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Shoulder / Crossbody Strap Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Detachable strap with 29\\&quot; drop for shoulder or crossbody wear</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </details>\n</div>",
